			"Message": "refactor(Maintain): Convert maintenance scripts from Bash to POSIX sh\n\nMigrate all dependency maintenance scripts in Land/Dependency/Maintain/ from Bash-specific syntax to POSIX-compliant sh. Key changes include:\n\n- Replace `#!/usr/bin/env bash` with `#!/usr/bin/env sh` shebangs\n- Convert `source` to `.` for sourcing files\n- Replace `mapfile` with while-read loops using heredocs for array handling\n- Replace `${BASH_SOURCE[0]}` with `$0` for script directory detection\n- Remove bash-isms like `\\` escapes before commands, `[[ ]]` to `[ ]`\n- Convert parameter expansion `${var/pattern/sub}` to use `sed` commands\n- Replace `for var in \"${array[@]}\"` with while-read loops over heredocs\n- Standardize folder path calculation using `_FN_DIR_` environment variable\n\nThese scripts handle dependency cloning, configuration, restoration, and synchronization across the Land Dependency monorepo. POSIX compliance ensures broader compatibility and easier debugging.",
